The [b]Community Mod Framework (CMF)[/b] is a utility mod that aims to improve mod inter-operability while giving modders tools for creating new features.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/main/assets/images/cmf/CMF_Banner.png[/img]

[b]CMF should be loaded first in your mod load order.[/b]

Any questions, feel free to reach out on the EU5 Mod Coop Discord: https://discord.gg/aqAAcCZsY7

[h1]Features[/h1]
[list]
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/Community-Mod-Menu]Community Mod Menu (CMM):[/url][/b] A shared in-game mod menu. Mod authors register settings dynamically through a simple API.
  [list]
   [*]Toggle, button, numeric, slider (double click to drag), dropdown, text (singleplayer-only), and list settings
   [*]Per-mod tabs, sub-tabs, groups, and search
   [*]Global settings with host-only multiplayer editing
   [*]Reset to Defaults (all mods, or just the selected mod)
   [*]Draggable window
   [*]Can be opened from the escape menu in-game. Or via the keybind ('m' by default, can be rebound).
   [*]Opens with no country selected, on the country selection lobby and in observer mode, showing your last country's values. Settings can't be changed until you have a country.
   [*][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/CMM-Visual-Editor]CMM Visual Editor[/url]: browser-based tool for creating your mod menu
  [/list]
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/Custom-Alerts]Custom Alerts:[/url][/b] Create and show custom alerts in the alert bar through localization keys, with configurable left-click actions and vanilla-style hide and mute.
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/Action-Bar]Action Bar:[/url][/b] Add custom action bar buttons with localization keys.
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/Mod-Banners]Mod Banners:[/url][/b] Display your mod as a banner on the pre-game lobby screen, with an icon, name, and description. Opt in with cmf_register_lobby_banner.
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/On-Action-Hooks#country-transfer]Country Transfer:[/url][/b] CMM settings automatically transfer when switching countries (tag switches, inheritance, etc.).
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/is_host-Trigger]is_host Trigger:[/url][/b] Check if the current country is controlled by the host player.
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/is_host-Trigger#cmf_can_use_unrestricted_tools]Unrestricted Tools Toggle:[/url][/b] Gate restricted features behind an "Enable Unrestricted Tools" setting (cmf_can_use_unrestricted_tools trigger, cmm_set_requires_unrestricted_tools_enabled per-setting flag). Only available for the host in multiplayer.
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/Mod-Detection]Mod Detection:[/url][/b] Check whether another mod is active with the cmf_is_mod_active trigger, or whether it was active when the game was started with cmf_was_mod_active_at_game_start.
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/Warning-Suppression]cmf_suppress Effect:[/url][/b] Suppress "used but never set" and "set but never used" engine warnings with a single effect call.
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/GUI-Macros]GUI Macros:[/url][/b] Nand, Nor, and Xor logical operator macros.
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/Improved-Vanilla-Top-Level-Widget-Overrides]Improved Vanilla Top-Level Widget Overrides:[/url][/b] Override a top-level vanilla widget (lateralviews, topbar, outliner entries, and more) without copying every type and template from its file. CMF includes the extracted definitions, so your override only needs the widget itself.
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/On-Action-Hooks]On-Action Hooks:[/url][/b] Post-lobby game start and save load hooks (on_game_start_after_lobby, on_game_load, on_game_load_after_lobby) with player country variants. Also includes shared yearly and monthly pulses for human players.
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/Mod-Action-Log]Mod Action Log:[/url][/b] Global in-game log for recording mod actions (e.g. host tool actions in multiplayer, as the log is unable to be cleared in MP).
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-toolkit]Community Mod Toolkit (CMT):[/url][/b] A companion set of development tools, such as a mod template, workshop uploader, and mod translator.
[/list]

